SUMMARY:Second Annual Summer Picnic Feast
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nDoing this 
 again because last year 35 of us basically had Thanksgiving in August and 
 it was too good not to repeat. Good food\, good people\, that's the whole 
 event.\n\nFull spread of homemade apps\, mains\, and dessert. If you were 
 there last year you already know. If you weren't\, ask around. Or just com
 e find out.\nBring a friend if you want. The more the merrier. This one's 
 as much about who shows up as what's on the table.\n**$25/person\,** pay a
 t the picnic via Cash or Zelle.\n**RSVP by** Thursday **August 20th** so w
 e know how much to cook.\n\nEvent Date: August 22nd Saturday ( Rain Date S
 unday August 23rd)\nTime: 2:30 pm\nLocation: Dunkerhook Park off Paramus R
 oad in Paramus Parking Lot B.
