 turday the 29th\, 2026\n10am-2pm\nBegins Student Recreation Center\n\nWha
 t to bring: Water\, Lunch\, Boots or Sneakers\, and Sunscreen.\n Potentia
 l Hazards: unpredictable weather changes\, sunburn/heat exhaustion\, dehy
 dration\, allergic reactions/poisonous plants\, insect bites\, injury by 
 running including sprains\, lacerations\, abrasions and fractures.\n\nHos
 ted by: Campus Recreation\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: http
