 Unfortunately\, her parents\, Harry and Zinnia\, fail to see that fact. As
  time passes\, she finally starts school and has a kind teacher\, loyal fr
 iends\, and a terrifying\, sadistic headmistress. As she becomes fed up wi
 th the constant cruelty\, she discovers she has a special gift that she ju
 st might be able to use to outwit the unruly adults around her.
