BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Thespaceforart": "https://thespaceforart.com/event/mindful-masculinity-mens-group-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:thespaceforart
X-SOURCE:The Space For Art
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260902T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260902T203000
DTSTAMP:20260821T214801Z
CREATED:20260610T145303Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260821T214801Z
UID:9629-1788375600-1788381000@thespaceforart.com
SUMMARY:Mindful Masculinity Men’s Group
DESCRIPTION:We Meet Bi-Weekly Every Other Wednesday | 7 – 8:30 pm | $15\n \nThrough open dialogue\, mindfulness\, and other calming practices we quiet the mind\, open the heart\, and deepen our connection to ourselves and each other. \nThe meetings are hosted by Leo\, mindfulness coach\, teacher\, and dad. \nWe start by sharing our wins and challenges\, honoring each voice without judgment or advice. \nWe dive into practices that help us release stress\, shift perspectives\, and bring  awareness and resilience into our lives. \nEach week\, we focus on a different topic to help guide our lives. Together\, we explore themes of trust\, accomplishments\, family\, rest\, intimacy\, and presence — discovering new ways to move through the world as mindful men. \nCome as you are.  Leave more grounded\, connected\, and inspired. \nConnect with Leo:\nInstagram @holdingpresence\nOnline: HoldingPresence.com\nE-Mail: pe***********@***il.com
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/mindful-masculinity-mens-group-2/
LOCATION:The Space\, 356 Bloomfield Ave\, loft #2\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Wellness
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/mindful-masculinity.jpg
END:VEVENT
