X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup North Jersey Bowling Soccer Volleyball": "https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball/events/316153130/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_north_jersey_bowling_soccer_volleyball
X-SOURCE:Meetup: NJ Bowling, Volleyball, Tennis & More
UID:event_316153130@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T020943Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260903T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260903T223000
SUMMARY:Speed Dating & Bachata Night — Newark | Singles 21+\, Beginners 
 Welcome
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis & More\nMeet single
  people face-to-face in Newark\, then learn bachata and salsa\nwith live D
 Js. DJ JdaBachata and DJ Carlita from Bachata Heaven. No partner needed\, 
 no experience needed. Come solo — most\npeople do.\n\nIf you're tired of
  dating apps\, new to New Jersey and looking to meet\npeople\, or you just
  want a fun night out where it's easy to talk to\nstrangers\, this is buil
 t for you.\n\nHOW THE NIGHT RUNS\n7:30 — Doors and mingling. Grab a drin
 k\, settle in.\n8:00 — Speed dating rounds. Structured and low-pressure\
 , so you actually meet everyone in the room. No guessing who's single.\n9:
 00 — Bachata and salsa lesson by DJ JdaBachata. Genuinely beginner-frien
 dly. If you have\nnever danced a step in your life\, you are the target au
 dience.\n9:30 — Social dancing until close\, with DJ JdaBachata and DJ C
 arlita.\n\nWHO COMES\nSingles roughly 21+ from Newark\, Jersey City\, the 
 Oranges\, Elizabeth\,\nand across Essex County\, Somerset County\, Hudson 
 County\, and North Jersey. Some come to date. Some come\nto make friends a
 nd meet people after moving to the area. Both are\nwelcome and both have a
  good night.\n\nMost people arrive alone. Most are complete beginners. You
  will fit in.\n\nDETAILS\nLancer's Restaurant\, 459 Ferry St #463\, Newark
 \, NJ 07105\nThursday\, September 3 — 7:30 PM to 10:45 PM\nTickets from 
 $20 early bird\, price rises closer to the date. Check out the link in the
  first comment.\n\nSpeed dating spots are capped\, so RSVP here and then g
 rab your ticket\nthrough the link. RSVP alone doesn't hold your spot in th
 e rounds.\n\nWe're also quietly celebrating Sheena's 40th\, which means th
 e room\nstarts the night already in a good mood. You don't need to know he
 r —\ncome as a stranger\, that's the whole point.\n\nQuestions before yo
 u come? Post in the group discussion. Someone always\nanswers.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/316153130/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260817T125345Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260817T125345Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
