DESCRIPTION:Ready to take your education global? Join us at the Study Abro
 ad Fair and explore a world of opportunities waiting just beyond your cam
 pus. Discover programs around the world\, meet representatives from our p
 artners and providers\, and hear firsthand stories from students who’ve a
 lready taken the leap.\nWhether you're dreaming of practicing your langua
 ge skills\, expanding your horizons in a new corner of the globe\, or eve
 n seeing a different part of the United States\, this is your chance to f
 ind the perfect fit. Learn about scholarships\, internships\, and how to 
 make your journey abroad both affordable and unforgettable.\n📅 Date: Wed
 nesday\, September 9\, 2026\n📍 Location: Student Center Quad    Rain Loc
 ation: Student Center Ballrooms⏰ Time: 1:30-4:00pm \n\nHosted by: Campus 
 Activities\, Office of International Academic Initiatives\n\nAdditional I
 nformation can be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event
 /12388181
