  struggling to write eulogies for eight of his men lost in the collapse of
  the World Trade Center\, discovering the profound humanity behind ordinar
 y heroes. Directed by David C. Neal.(Recommended for 13 & older)Add to cal
 endarGoogle CalendariCalendarOutlook 365Outlook Live
LOCATION:The Oakeside Bloomfield Cultural Center\, 240 Belleville Ave\, Bl
 oomfield\, NJ
URL:https://skylinetheatrecompany.org/event/the-guys-by-anne-nelson/
