DESCRIPTION:South Mountain Conservancy Activities Meetup Group\n### **Star
 ting August 22nd\, registration will be open for the 13th SMR Family Campo
 ut on Saturday and Sunday\, September 19th to 20th\, (rain dates\, Septemb
 er 26th to 27th). Sponsored by the South Mountain Conserancy with the supp
 ort of Essex County Parks\, this award-winning program caters to families 
 with young children ages 4 to 11. With nature-intensive programing\, this 
 overnight program provides an opportunity for families new to camping or j
 ust in love with nature to experience a special experience close. Generall
 y\, this event fills up in 2 to 3 days.**\n\n***DO NOT REGISTER ON MEETUP.
  GO [HERE](https://www.somocon.org/family-campout/2026-fall-smr-family-cam
 pout/) for more information and registration instructions.***
