DESCRIPTION:Registration & $5 donation is REQUIRED at the Reference 
 Desk\n\nSchedule a 60 minute\, one-on-one session with Linda Leddy\, our 
 tech Friend! We'll get you connected to your computer\, your cell phone\, 
 your tablet!!\n\nPlease give 24 hour notice if you are unable to make your 
 appointment.
