CREATED:20260805T155053Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>On Sunday\, October 18\, we kick off our</span><strong><
 b> Stewardship Campaign</b></strong><span>. This is the time of year whe
 n we each </span><strong><b>recommit</b></strong><span> our </span><str
 ong><b>time\, talent\, and treasure </b></strong><span>to the Holy Spirit
  Verona Community. This year’s theme </span><strong><b>"Plenty Good Ro
 om" </b></strong><span>is an opportunity to be </span><strong><b>reminde
 d that there are "many rooms" in God's house\, as the Gospel Writer of Joh
 n tells us</b></strong><strong><b>.</b></strong><span><span> </span>How a
 re you welcoming others to Holy Spirit Verona? There is ALWAYS room at the
  table. Here is a recent<span> </span></span><a href="https://www.holyspi
 ritverona.org/uploads/1/4/2/4/142411498/pgr_reflections_season_after_pente
 cost_editedjar.pdf" target="_blank">Stewardship Reflection Insert</a><span
 ><span> </span>for you to review.</span><br><br><span>Please consider NOW
  how you'll support the work of Holy Spirit Verona next year with your tim
 e\, talent\, treasure. Can you pledge more\, pledge the same or consider a
 dding a ministry to your experience.<span> </span></span><strong><b>Forms
  will become available in September.<span> </span></b></strong><span>On P
 entecost\, the disciples discovered that there is no limit to God’s gene
 rosity. The same is true for us. When we trust the Spirit and share freely
 \, God multiplies our gifts and sends us out as witnesses to love. There i
 s indeed plenty good room – for every culture\, every language\, every p
 erson – in the household of God.</span><br><br><span><u><span>Stewardshi
 p 2026-27 Timeline</span></u><span>:</span></span><br><span><span>Sundays\
 , October 11- November 29 -<strong><b><span><span> </span>Stewardship Que
 stions Inserts</span></b></strong><span> </span>in Sunday Bulletin (or on
 line)</span></span><br><span><span>Sunday\, October 18 -<span> </span><st
 rong><b><span>Kick-Off<span> </span></span></b></strong>/<span> </span><
 /span><span><strong><b><span>Stewardship Materials</span></b></strong></sp
 an><span><span> </span>Available (electronically and in Church)</span></s
 pan><br><span><span>Sundays\, October 11 &amp\; 18\, November 8\, 15 &amp\
 ; 22 -<span> </span><strong><b><span>stories of members</span></b></stron
 g><span> </span>shared at 10am worship</span></span><br><span><span>Sunda
 y\, November 22 -<span> </span><strong><b><span>In-Giving<span> </span><
 /span></b></strong>Sunday /<span> </span><strong><b><span>Re-Commitment F
 orms Returned</span></b></strong><span><span> </span>[deadline to be in t
 he raffle for "dinner for two" prepared by your clergy\; three winners wil
 l be drawn.]</span></span></span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260805T155053Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
X-SOURCE:Church of the Holy Spirit Verona
END:VEVENT
