DESCRIPTION:**Untangling the Israeli Elections**  \nMetrowest Shlicha\, Da
 niella Geffen\, will explain the upcoming Israeli election candidates &amp
 \; party platforms and the protocol for establishing a coalition to govern
  Israel.  \n  \nAn educator\, clinical social worker\, and community activ
 ist\, Daniella brings years of experience working across diverse communiti
 es and fostering bridge-building initiatives in Jerusalem.  \n  \nSponsore
 d by the Shomrei Israel Committee  \n  \n**RSVP required:**  \n  \n  \n**Q
 uestions?** Contact the Shomrei Office  \noffice@shomrei.org  \n(973) 746-
 5031 ext. 0\n\n
