DESCRIPTION:<span>Ou<span>r congregation will host <b><span>a meal at Chri
 stine's Kitchen on Saturday\, October 31\, 2026</span></b>. </span><span><
 a href="http://holytrinitywo.org/christine's-kitchen" target="_blank"><b><
 span>Christine's Kitchen</span></b></a></span><span> is a feeding ministry
  at Holy Trinity Episcopal Church in West Orange. Volunteers are making lu
 nch and desserts which will be delivered to Christine's Kitchen on Saturda
